3:21	compose:remember-missing-check	manual	Using `mutableStateOf` in a @Composable function without it being inside of a remember function.\nIf you don't remember the state instance, a new state instance will be created when the function is recomposed.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#state-should-be-remembered-in-composables for more information.
